# Storage
# Runtime state (session plans, decision audit, trade json) is machine-written
# and must never be committed.
# NOTE: this must be `storage/*` and NOT `storage/`. Git never descends into
# a directory it has excluded, so with `storage/` the exceptions below are
# never even examined -- verified with `git check-ignore`, which reported the
# analyst files as IGNORED until this line was changed.
storage/*
# ...but the analyst comparison records are deliberate, hand-written evidence:
# they are the only account of what the manual analyst called, and the
# head-to-head scoreboard reads them. Ignoring them meant every label had to be
# force-added or was silently lost on upload.
!storage/*_analyst_label.csv
!storage/*_head_to_head.md
!storage/analyst_labels_*.json
*.json.bak

